/-!
# The polynomial `((1 + w z)^p - 1) / w^p` and cyclotomic quotient extensions

This module only re-exports its parts:

* `OneAddPow.QuotientPolynomial`: the polynomial `P` attached to a primitive `p`-th root of
  unity and Lemma 15.117.13 (Stacks tag 09F2);
* `OneAddPow.GaloisDegree`: an extension generated by a root of `P(z) = ξ` is Galois of degree
  dividing `p`, and the reductions used for its ramification;
* `OneAddPow.RamificationCases`: the ramification alternatives of such an extension over a
  mixed-characteristic discrete valuation ring (Stacks tag 09F3).
-/
